OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather windy with showers in
OL,6,Fthe west, some heavy at times. Further
OL,7,Feast it will mainly dry, with the
OL,8,Flongest sunny spells around the Moray
OL,9,FFirth.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowery rain spreads into the
OL,12,Fwest this evening, extending northeast
OL,13,Fovernight, though much of the Moray
OL,14,FFirth likely remaining dry. Southerly
OL,15,Fwinds strengthening, risk of coastal
OL,16,Fgales in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
