OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright spells and showers at
OL,6,Ffirst. Turning cloudier with rain
OL,7,Fspreading northeast during the day,
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy for a time. Rather
OL,9,Fwindy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSouthwesterly winds persist through
OL,13,Fthis period and bring largely cloudy
OL,14,Fskies with rain or showers, but
OL,15,Fgenerally drier and brighter around
OL,16,Fthe Moray Firth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
